{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Traveling Cart is a shop that appears south of ",["l","农场","The Farm"]," in ",["l","煤矿森林","Cindersap Forest"]," on Fridays and Sundays, closing at 8pm. It also appears each day of the ",["l","夜市","Night Market"]," (",["l","冬季","Winter"]," 15-17) and each day of the ",["l","沙漠节","Desert Festival"]," (",["l","春季","Spring"]," 15-17). Stock changes each day the Traveling Merchant appears. The merchant will sell a selection of ten random items in limited quantities (1 or 5 of each) as \"standard stock\", plus one piece of furniture at any one time. There may be an additional \"special stock\" item for sale as well."]],["p",["Traveling Cart prices may vary from visit to visit. Prices are usually quite inflated, but every once in a while an item can be sold for less than its normal price. Do note that items are sometimes found for sale outside their normal seasons, which can be helpful for completing ",["l","收集包","bundles"],"."]],["p",["The cart is pulled by a pig wearing a fez and spectacles. Interacting with the pig will result in it oinking at the character. During the ",["l","夜市","Night Market"],", the pig floats behind the cart in an inner tube."]]]],["Special Stock",2,[["p",["Note that the ",["l","咖啡豆","Coffee Bean"]," and ",["l","稀有种子","Rare Seed"]," may also be sold during any season as Standard Stock."]],["t",[[{"c":2,"h":1,"v":["Item"]},{"h":1,"v":["Unit Price"]},{"h":1,"v":["Season"]},{"h":1,"v":["Notes"]}],[[["f","Rare_Seed.png",48]],[["l","稀有种子","Rare Seed"]],["1,000g"],["Spring / Summer"],["100% chance to appear.\n10% chance for 5 stacks; 90% chance for 1 stack."]],[[["f","Rarecrow_4.png",48]],[["l","稻草人#Rarecrows","Rarecrow #4"]],["4,000g"],["Fall / Winter"],["40% chance to appear."]],[[["f","Coffee_Bean.png",48]],[["l","咖啡豆","Coffee Bean"]],["2,500g"],["Fall / Winter"],["25% chance to appear."]],[[["f","Red_Fez.png",48]],[["l","红色菲斯帽","Red Fez"]],["8,000g"],["Any season"],["10% chance to appear."]],[[["f","Joja_Furniture_Catalogue.png",48]],[["l","Joja家具目录","Joja Furniture Catalogue"]],["30,000g"],["Any season"],["10% chance to appear if the ",["l","社区中心","Community Center"]," ",["l","收集包","Bundles"]," have been completed."]],[[["f","Junimo_Catalogue.png",48]],[["l","祝尼魔目录","Junimo Catalogue"]],["70,000g"],["Any season"],["10% chance to appear if either the ",["l","社区中心","Community Center"]," ",["l","收集包","Bundles"]," or the ",["l","Joja社区发展申请书","Joja Community Development Form"]," has been completed."]],[[["f","Retro_Catalogue.png",48]],[["l","复古目录","Retro Catalogue"]],["110,000g"],["Any season"],["10% chance to appear."]],[[["f","Tea_Set.png",48]],[["l","茶具","Tea Set"]],["1,000,000g"],["Any season"],["5% chance to appear from Year 25 onwards."]],[[["f","Stardew_Valley_Almanac.png",48]],[["l","星露谷年历","Stardew Valley Almanac"]],["6,000g"],["Any season"],{"r":5,"v":["5% chance for one of the five skill books to appear."]}],[[["f","Bait_And_Bobber.png",48]],[["l","鱼饵和浮漂","Bait And Bobber"]],["6,000g"],["Any season"]],[[["f","Woodcutter's_Weekly.png",48]],[["l","樵夫周刊","Woodcutter's Weekly"]],["6,000g"],["Any season"]],[[["f","Mining_Monthly.png",48]],[["l","采矿月刊","Mining Monthly"]],["6,000g"],["Any season"]],[[["f","Combat_Quarterly.png",48]],[["l","战斗季刊","Combat Quarterly"]],["6,000g"],["Any season"]],[[],[["l","结婚戒指","Wedding Ring"]," Recipe"],["500g"],["Any season"],[["l","合作","Multiplayer"]," only: 100% chance to appear until purchased.\nSingleplayer: Does not appear."]]]]]],["Spouse Portraits",2,[["p",["Once a villager becomes your spouse, or Krobus becomes your roommate, their portrait becomes available to buy. It will show up every time the Traveling Cart visits as long as you have 14 hearts with your spouse/roommate at the time. These portraits have a fixed 30,000g price."]],["t",[[{"c":3,"h":1,"v":["Spouse/Roommate Portraits"]}],[[["i","(F)AbigailPortrait","Abigail Portrait"]],[["i","(F)AlexPortrait","Alex Portrait"]],[["i","(F)ElliottPortrait","Elliott Portrait"]]],[[["i","(F)EmilyPort